        <mxCell id="s4note" value="Many-to-many:  INDUSTRY_CONSULTANTS &gt;—— CONSULTANT_COURSES ——&lt; COURSES&#10;&#10;Delete rules differ on purpose: deleting a CONSULTANT cascades their links away,&#10;but deleting a COURSE only nulls the link — re-uploading a curriculum replaces&#10;the term's COURSES rows, and the assignment must survive that." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#616161;" vertex="1" parent="1">
